   },
   {
    "en": "6.4"
   },
   {
    "en": "12.5"
   },
   {
    "en": "8"
   }
  ],
  "answer": 1,
  "explanation": {
   "en": "For two numbers GM² = AM × HM, so HM = 64/10 = 6.4."
