   },
   {
    "en": "34.16%"
   }
  ],
  "answer": 3,
  "explanation": {
   "en": "Use the GM of the growth factors: √(1.2 × 1.5) = √1.8 = 1.3416. Average rate = 34.16%. (The AM, 35%, overstates it.)"
